# ============================================================
#  YZZ -- what is NOT version controlled
# ============================================================
#  Everything below is either downloadable (runtimes) or machine
#  state / secrets (login state, caches). The repo keeps only the
#  launcher, the hub (TUI + scripts) and the docs, so a clone stays
#  a few dozen KB instead of ~2 GB.

# ---- runtimes: re-download, see README "重建运行时" ----
/runtime/
/npm-global/
/dsh/

# ---- machine state: fake user profile, temp, logs ----
/home/
/temp/
/logs/

# ---- user data (whatever you work on from the TUI) ----
/workspace/

# ---- OS / editor junk ----
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~

# ---- logs / crash dumps ----
*.log
*.dmp

# ---- downloaded installers (keep the URL in README, not the blob) ----
*.zip
*.7z
*.msi
